| --- | --- | --- |
| `crates/server/src/db/pg.rs` | change | `to_match` reads a NULL `p2_profile_id` as `""`; `replay_row` and `replays_list_with_modes` lose their now-redundant pre-fill; `profiles_get_many` drops ids that are not uuids; KNOWN DIVERGENCES "deleted accounts" bullet rewritten |
