   ```rust
           // See KNOWN DIVERGENCES (deleted accounts): a deleted seat, either one, reads back as an
           // empty id.
           players: (
               row.p1_profile_id.unwrap_or_default(),
               row.p2_profile_id.unwrap_or_default(),
           ),
   ```
